{
  "id": "credit",
  "title": "赊房钱、到期提醒、还款与次日续住",
  "requirements": [
    "L1",
    "L7"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我走进青灯酒馆找林穗。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我想按店里的赊账条件先住一晚，六铜房钱一小时后还，现在先不付现钱。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_trade"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "amount": 6,
            "paid": 0,
            "status": "待偿还"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "contract",
            "paid": 0,
            "status": "有效"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我还想再赊一只面包。超过未还欠款上限就算了，不拿东西，也不改为现付。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在酒馆等一个小时，暂时不还欠款，不买其他东西。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 60
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "status": "逾期",
            "paid": 0
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.relationships.player.trust",
          "value": -5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）查一下我实际欠多少钱，是否过期，有什么已经发生的后果。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "status": "逾期"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我现在拿六枚铜币交给林穗，把刚才的房钱欠款全部还清；这是还债，不是另订客房。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_trade"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": -6
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "status": "已还清",
            "paid": 6
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "contract",
            "paid": 6
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在已租的房间休息到明天上午十点，不再买东西。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "range",
          "path": "state.minute",
          "min": 2040,
          "max": 2060
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "contract",
            "status": "已到期"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "既然昨天那一晚已经到期，我再付六铜续住一天，现在现付。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_trade"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": -6
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "contract",
            "status": "有效",
            "paid": 6
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "contract",
            "status": "已到期"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）最后核对欠款是否清零、实际余额，以及今天续住的期限。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 168
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "debt",
            "status": "已还清"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "赊账不冒充已付款，到期与还款以记录为准，不把还债误作续住",
    "agency": "不替玩家自动偿还、加购或放弃住宿",
    "language": "用简体中文自然回应，不暴露参数或编号",
    "continuity": "保留违约后果，区分昨天已到期的住宿与今天续住"
  }
}
